{"title":"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_1_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 1 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(quick,_no_graphing)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (quick, no graphing)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Sine_and_Cosine_Graph)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Sine and Cosine Graph)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d523c1c35268dc2f2a2d6ea8be772659897b3a21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;\\theta\\le 2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b58210a8828d746350c9d6235739f48869ca7cf6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1-3\\sin\\theta+5\\cos3\\theta = 0?\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54d10ea6a8b5f9a2d48edf5f0e8f458eff218e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }5\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }6 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We rearrange to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/6403161c0a12179aebce70cb4619ca393d783ee5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\cos3\\theta = 3\\sin\\theta-1.\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"13\" />\nWe can graph two functions in this case: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04c00f1ee6cd9b60e50b3b52ecfc6f3c84bdb0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=5\\cos{3x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/686439407c1a6113389695391daf0e1f2f0593f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3\\sin{x} -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />.\nUsing transformation of functions, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06090ad2ad42598f8eb9d3318f12238a2dc6241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cos{3x}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is just a cosine function with amplitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and period <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a1f43766bf2f5511df35ab6d4a0b84dbcb6dadb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"22\" height=\"37\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/8/5b8d95602401e71129ec7d769fca0f103b2c4c7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\sin{x} -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" /> is just a sine function with amplitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and shifted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> unit downward:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/0/ac0756ac2aff279bb152a3f7a2f32a2fc7319a66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph;  size(400,200,IgnoreAspect);  real Sin(real t) {return 3*sin(t) - 1;} real Cos(real t) {return 5*cos(3*t);}  draw(graph(Sin,0, 2pi),red,&quot;$3\\sin{x} -1 $&quot;); draw(graph(Cos,0, 2pi),blue,&quot;$5\\cos{3x}$&quot;);  xaxis(&quot;$x$&quot;,BottomTop,LeftTicks); yaxis(&quot;$y$&quot;,LeftRight,RightTicks(trailingzero));  add(legend(),point(E),20E,UnFill); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"335\" />\nSo, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79d327a2ed1b158c28ca33e5d5a88f2b4d037b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" /> solutions. \n</p><p>~Jamess2022 (burntTacos)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Just_1_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Just_1_min!)\">Video Solution (Just 1 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Just 1 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2wYcntg1mCc\">https://youtu.be/2wYcntg1mCc</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything </i>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28quick.2C_no_graphing.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(quick,_no_graphing)\">Video Solution (quick, no graphing)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (quick, no graphing)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YTn5YPQt6IY\">https://youtu.be/YTn5YPQt6IY</a>\n~  MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Using_Sine_and_Cosine_Graph.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Sine_and_Cosine_Graph)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Sine and Cosine Graph)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Sine and Cosine Graph)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/toBOpc6vS6s\">https://youtu.be/toBOpc6vS6s</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p4iCAZRUESs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p4iCAZRUESs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B\">2021 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b